Kroger reported net earnings of $1.54 per diluted share for 2025, a decrease of 58% from $3.67 per diluted share for 2024 [1]. The fiscal year ended January 31, 2026 is Kroger's fiscal 2025.

On an adjusted basis, which excludes certain items the filing defines as "Adjusted Items," adjusted net earnings were $4.85 per diluted share for 2025, up 9% from $4.47 for 2024 [1]. The reconciliation shows that the largest adjustment was $2.91 per share for fulfillment network impairment and related charges [2].